    comment "en" """
        Source V2040 (Swedish extension of WHO V20.4) = motorcycle driver injured in traffic collision
        with pedestrian/animal while engaged in sport/activity. Activity-context digit is
        administrative, not clinically represented in SNOMED CT. WHO V20.4 (concept 45561171) Athena
        crosswalk Maps-to SNOMED CT 438310 (Victim, motorcycle rider in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident,
        SNOMED CT 10298002). Target fully subsumes the source: every such case is a motorcycle-rider
        traffic-accident victim. One-level broader; crosswalk-verified on parent.
        """
}
